      "writtenOn": "2025-04-10T08:57:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need a different error code here (ENOSPC?). ENOMEM would topup the memcache and go back to the host. But in that case we\u0027ve ran out of hyp_req and that\u0027s something not expected and probably we should just come back to the guest with an error.",
